@startuml
title App session: chat in the browser
autonumber

actor "Visitor" as visitor
participant "Browser\n(chat.html + JS)" as browser
participant "API Gateway" as apigw
participant "webapp\n(FastAPI)" as web
participant "ConversationStore\n(in-memory)" as store
participant "ConversationEngine" as engine

== Start of a session ==
visitor -> browser : opens the site
browser -> apigw : GET /
apigw -> web
web --> browser : 303 redirect to /c/{uuid4}
browser -> apigw : GET /c/{uuid4}
apigw -> web
web -> store : load(conversation_id)
store --> web : empty Conversation
web --> browser : chat page (history embedded\nas escaped Markdown)
browser -> apigw : GET /static/marked.min.js,\n/static/purify.min.js
apigw -> web
web --> browser : vendored scripts
browser -> browser : render history as sanitized Markdown
note right of web
  The page does not need the backends:
  the history is read from the store only.
  API Gateway reaches the webapp via
  VPC Link and Cloud Map.
end note

== Ask question ==
visitor -> browser : types a question
browser -> browser : show question,\nshow pending bubble
browser -> apigw : fetch POST /api/conversations/{id}/messages
apigw -> web
ref over web, engine
  Answer flow:
  see sequence-retrieval-api.puml
  (rate limit, condensation, retrieval, generation)
end ref
web --> browser : 200 ChatResponse
browser -> browser : render answer as Markdown\n(sanitized)
browser --> visitor : answer

== Error during a turn ==
browser -> apigw : fetch POST /api/conversations/{id}/messages
apigw -> web
web --> browser : 4xx / 5xx {detail}
browser -> browser : replace pending bubble\nby error message
browser --> visitor : message, input enabled again

== Reload or return ==
visitor -> browser : reloads /c/{uuid4}
browser -> apigw : GET /c/{uuid4}
apigw -> web
alt id is not a UUID4
  web --> browser : 303 redirect to /
else conversation known
  web -> store : load(conversation_id)
  store --> web : full history
  web --> browser : chat page with earlier turns
else idle longer than TTL or evicted (LRU)
  web -> store : load(conversation_id)
  store --> web : new empty Conversation
  web --> browser : empty chat page
end
@enduml
